The co-design process yielded:
● a four-phase life-cycle diagram (Discovery, Assessment, Development, Monitoring);
● stage-specific checklists covering acceptance, fairness, and transparency metrics;
● practical implementation guidance (eg, role assignments, artefact templates) for each
phase.

